#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: sheets.appdata.xml:9
msgid ""
"Calligra Sheets is a fully-featured calculation and spreadsheet tool. Use it"
" to quickly create and calculate various business-related spreadsheets, such"
" as income and expenditure, employee working hours, etc."
msgstr ""
"Calligra Sheets é unha ferramenta completa de follas de cálculo. Úsea para"
" crear rapidamente follas de cálculo de negocios, como por exemplo follas de"
" gastos e ingresos, de horas de traballo, etc."

